OWNERSHIP
---------

The core idea, concept, design, and this repository belong solely to the
copyright holder stated above. All screens, flows, documents, prototypes,
contracts, database schemas, source code, and marketing copy in this
repository are original work created for and owned by the holder, unless
explicitly marked otherwise in the COMPONENT RECORD section below.

No claim is made by this file over third-party open-source components;
dependencies (pip/npm/pub) remain under their own upstream licenses, which
this project respects.

