  All "Planned" rows carry the standing rule: verify the actual license at
  the pinned version before moving the row to "In use". Additional notes
  recorded in advance: trafilatura is Apache-2.0 since v1.8.0 (GPLv3+
  before -- pin >= 1.8.0); flet-android-notifications wraps
  flutter_local_notifications (its upstream terms apply).

Services (no software license -- provider terms of service apply):

  - Meta Model API (dev.meta.ai, /compat/v1): structured outputs for note
    generation / cloud chat. Never the contributor pricing tier (it trains
    on user data); cloud ASR likewise routed through the regular paid rate.
  - Any other cloud provider must support the same Provider Protocol, and
    its data terms must respect "transcripts are text and are kept; media
    never persisted".

Excluded as third-party: this repository's own content (governed
exclusively by this LICENSE), and generated fixtures (Docs/api/fixtures/)
authored inside Docs/api/generate_fixtures.py.

